17. Final recommendation
Harmony Frequency should be built around reliable listening, clear
personal choice and credible explanations. The near-term strategy is
not to add every possible wellness feature. Establish a dependable
player, make the first session obvious, support intention- or
frequency-led discovery, then test whether optional ambience and
affirmations produce repeat value.
The most important instruction for Jules is: audit first, prove the
current state, report gaps, and wait for approval before
implementation. This protects the existing architecture and user data
while giving the product owner a defensible basis for deciding what to
build next.
